1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,040
现在 有请学生致辞代表
And now, please welcome your valedictorian,

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:04,340
艾丽克斯·邓菲
Alex Dunphy.

3
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,080
我爸妈哪去了
Where are my mom and dad?

4
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,180
拐角要出现的是
and in this corner,

5
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,700
班级名次第一
finishing first in her class,

6
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,580
毕业典礼学生致辞代表
delivering the commencement address,

7
00:00:23,613 --> 00:00:25,896
体重有 你多重来着 宝贝
weighing in at -- what do you weigh, honey?

8
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:26,380
爸
Dad!

9
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:29,320
同龄女孩标准体重
A healthy amount for a girl her age.

10
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:30,520
这些都拍下了吗
are you getting all this, buddy?

11
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:31,640
一句不漏
Pure gold.

12
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:32,740
她是智力大王
She's the main brain,

13
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:36,000
舞会奇葩 艾丽克斯·邓菲
the cerebellum of the ball, Alex Dunphy!!

14
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,120
继续拍啊 等我最终变疯子时
Oh, keep rolling, The News will want this footage

15
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,398
《新闻》肯定想要这段录像
when I eventually snap.

16
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:42,400
我还以为桑杰·帕特尔是全班第一呢
I thought Sanjay Patel was first in the class.

17
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,840
本来是的 不过他缺了几周课
He was until he missed a few weeks

18
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,420
因为他被自己造的机器人袭击了
and the robot he was building attacked him.

19
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,000
这种事还真发生了 人类啊
It's happening, people.

20
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,400
聪明反被聪明误
Our hubris will be our undoing.

21
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:50,020
宝贝 你跟我
Sweetie, what do you say you and I

22
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,280
一起去美甲怎么样
go and get our nails done, huh?

23
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:53,040
不了 我要背演讲稿
It's okay. I want to work on my speech.

24
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,100
老爸也经历过
Been there.

25
00:00:54,162 --> 00:00:56,837
高中时 我获选了西语俱乐部财务委员
I remember the speech that won me treasurer

26
00:00:56,874 --> 00:00:58,971
竞选演讲仍记忆犹新
of my high-school spanish club.

27
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:00,880
[西语]"我的名字叫菲利
"Mi nombre es Felipe.

28
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:03,400
我来到这座学校..."
Yo voy a la escuela..."

29
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:04,120
菲利 有完没完
Felipe.

30
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:06,820
这事可了不起啦
It was kind of a grande deal.

31
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:08,640
对手是地道的波多黎各人
I was up against an actual puerto rican.

32
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,680
真不去了吗 宝贝
Honey, are you sure?

33
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,520
说不定美甲师还能做出校园色呢
Because I think they can do school colors.

34
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:13,980
-不用了 妈妈 -好吧
- I'm good, mom. - Okay.

35
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:18,180
家庭重要大事总会让克莱尔情绪激动
Family milestones always throw Claire for a loop.

36
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,620
她会极力忍耐
She holds it in,

37
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:21,340
然后在第二天 会来个情绪大爆发
and then the next day, she has a total meltdown,

38
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:22,560
我就得收拾这个烂摊子
and I have to pick up the pieces.

39
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,820
可问题是 明天
Problem is, tomorrow,

40
00:01:25,820 --> 00:01:27,480
我要和好哥们一起去拉斯维加斯
I'm supposed to go to vegas with my buds,

41
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:31,226
我得让她在今天就爆发出来
So...I need her to melt down today.

42
00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:33,460
不然的话 可就真的"赌城奇事赌城止"了
Otherwise, what happens in Vegas won't happen to me

43
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:34,580
因为我去不了
because I won't be there.

44
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,880
百感交集的一天 对吧
Emotional day, huh?

45
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,280
喜悦的一天
Happy day.

46
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,640
悲喜交加吧
Happy and sad.

47
00:01:44,260 --> 00:01:45,780
"兄弟们 老婆突然崩溃
"Guys, I can't go to Vegas

48
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:47,420
我去不了维加斯了"
because my wife's freaking out!"

49
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:50,160
相信我 这样的电话绝对
Trust me, that is not a phone call you want to make

50
00:01:50,193 --> 00:01:52,667
不能打给前大学啦啦队的兄弟们
to a bunch of ex-college male cheerleaders.

51
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:56,060
他们能编出一套顺口溜来嘲笑你
They will mock you with a hurtful, rhythmic taunt.

52
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:02,680
喂
Hello?

53
00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:04,100
歌洛莉亚 是我
Gloria, it's me.

54
00:02:04,137 --> 00:02:05,710
医生怎么说
Ay! How was the doctor?

55
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,700
你回家的时候 能顺便捎点面包吗
Can you pick up some bread on the way home, please?

56
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,220
我到家了 院门遥控器坏了
I'm home. My damn gate remote won't work.

57
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,080
你能不能按一下...
Could you press...

58
00:02:11,106 --> 00:02:12,136
-喂 -...9呢
- Hello? - ...9?

59
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:14,120
-曼尼 没事的 -什么没事
- Manny, it's okay. - What's okay?

60
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:14,980
出了什么事
What's wrong?

61
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:17,920
-你从哪打来的 -我没打给你啊
- Where are you calling from? - I'm not calling from.

62
00:02:17,953 --> 00:02:19,038
是杰打的电话
Jay is calling.

63
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:19,880
杰又怎么了
What's wrong with Jay?

64
00:02:20,060 --> 00:02:21,340
我的按钮坏了
My clicker won't work.

65
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:22,360
老天爷啊
Oh, my god

66
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:23,440
你心脏停跳了
your heart's not working?!

67
00:02:23,461 --> 00:02:25,508
那你怎么还能和我们讲电话
How could you tell us this over the phone?!

68
00:02:25,540 --> 00:02:26,740
我心脏没事
My heart is fine.

69
00:02:26,773 --> 00:02:29,787
谁帮帮忙按下9键 放我进去行吗
Would somebody please press 9 and let me in?

70
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:30,780
-好的 -收到
- Okay .-Got it.

71
00:02:31,660 --> 00:02:34,360
你们同时接 按下键也没用
It won't work if you're both on the line.

72
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,265
-那我挂了 -那我挂了
- Okay. - Okay.

73
00:02:37,540 --> 00:02:39,300
怎么每次都这样
Every damn time!

74
00:02:42,139 --> 00:02:44,612
来 莉莉 该穿衣服
Okay, Lily, time to get dressed. Okay.

75
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:46,760
一晃眼艾丽克斯居然要上高中了
I can't believe Alex is gonna be in high school.

76
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:48,240
我真是老了
I feel so old!

77
00:02:48,282 --> 00:02:49,298
不光你一个人这么觉得
Oh, well, you feel old.

78
00:02:49,340 --> 00:02:50,700
我看着她出生的
I was there when she was born --

79
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:52,080
就在产房
in the delivery room.

80
00:02:52,107 --> 00:02:53,986
要我以前不是同志的话 我就[硬不起来了]
If I wasn't gay before, I --

81
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:55,760
得了吧 那你在农场2分钟都呆不了
Oh, please, you wouldn't have lasted two minutes on a farm.

82
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:57,040
什么动物产崽我都见过
I've witnessed all kinds of birthing --

83
00:02:57,380 --> 00:02:58,320
眼睛都不带眨一下的
never batted an eye.

84
00:02:58,580 --> 00:03:00,140
我见过牛生犊 猪产崽
I've seen cattle, I've seen hogs,

85
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:00,680
羊下羔...
I've seen goats --

86
00:03:00,712 --> 00:03:01,566
我还见过一只三条腿的...
I've even seen a three-legged --

87
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:05,100
老天啊
Oh, my god!

88
00:03:05,110 --> 00:03:08,000
老天啊
Oh, my god!

89
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:10,620
-我不是故意的 -你笑得出来 米奇尔
- I'm sorry. - Really, mitchell?

90
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:11,740
我刚才可能就这么撒手人寰了
I could have just died.

91
00:03:28,651 --> 00:03:32,106
凯茨勒校长 教职工们 家长们
Principal Kaizler, faculty, parents,

92
00:03:32,146 --> 00:03:33,183
亲爱的同学们 今天站...
fellow graduates, it's --

93
00:03:33,204 --> 00:03:34,583
嗨 小明星
Hey, superstar.

94
00:03:34,634 --> 00:03:36,900
你在背演讲稿呢
Oh, you're working on your speech.

95
00:03:36,930 --> 00:03:38,028
对的
Yep.

96
00:03:38,058 --> 00:03:39,166
需要帮忙吗
Well, do you need any help?

97
00:03:39,206 --> 00:03:40,516
因为有时候
Because sometimes it's great

98
00:03:40,546 --> 00:03:42,258
应该向你敬重的人请教
to bounce ideas off someone whose opinion you value.

99
00:03:42,289 --> 00:03:43,336
我就不用了
I'm good.

100
00:03:43,366 --> 00:03:45,653
好吧 没关系
Okay. That's cool.

101
00:03:45,683 --> 00:03:46,851
我们给你做做头发吧
We could do your hair.

102
00:03:46,902 --> 00:03:48,473
咱可以做个杂志里那种发型
We could do it like we saw in that magazine.

103
00:03:48,493 --> 00:03:50,628
就是那个女明星...叫什么名字来着
Oh, what's that actress -- what's her name? --

104
00:03:50,658 --> 00:03:51,303
一排大白牙的那个
With the -- you know, with the teeth?

105
00:03:51,303 --> 00:03:52,552
妈妈 别说了行吗
Mom, mom, please.

106
00:03:52,582 --> 00:03:54,184
-我正专心准备呢 -好吧
- I'm -- I'm trying to concentrate. - Okay.

107
00:03:54,234 --> 00:03:55,946
行
Okay.

108
00:03:56,671 --> 00:03:58,061
你半个小时后就准备走吧
Well, you be ready to go in a half-hour,

109
00:03:58,112 --> 00:03:59,874
我们要和你爷爷拼车去
because we are going to carpool with your grandpa.

110
00:03:59,915 --> 00:04:01,476
海莉开车送我
Haley's driving me.

111
00:04:01,506 --> 00:04:03,520
我想提前到校
I want to get there early.

112
00:04:03,561 --> 00:04:05,092
想法不错
That's a great idea.

113
00:04:05,122 --> 00:04:07,015
到时学校见
Great. I will see you there...

114
00:04:07,056 --> 00:04:09,272
小明星
Superstar.

115
00:04:10,279 --> 00:04:12,898
喂 熊妈妈 还好吗
Hey, mama bear. You okay?

116
00:04:12,938 --> 00:04:14,620
别叫我"熊妈妈" 我才不是呢
Not with "Mama bear" I'm not.

117
00:04:14,650 --> 00:04:16,010
-不要哭 -我没哭
- Don't cry. - I'm not crying.

118
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,360
嘘 难受就别忍着
Shh! Don't be brave.

119
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:19,520
我会陪伴你身边
I'm here for you.

120
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:22,980
直到明天下午两点 我将乘机前往维加斯
Until 2 p.m. Tomorrow, when my flight leaves for vegas.

121
00:04:24,681 --> 00:04:27,172
你去哪了 你买面包回来了吗
Where were you? Did you bring the bread?

122
00:04:27,220 --> 00:04:28,820
我被那扇门拒之门外
I was stuck outside that gate

123
00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:30,280
等了足足10分钟它才开
for 10 minutes before it opened.

124
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:31,180
那就是没买面包咯
So no bread?

125
00:04:31,210 --> 00:04:33,070
我们得把那破门修好
We got to get that thing fixed. Ay!

126
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:34,260
你的眼睛怎么了
What happened to your eye?

127
00:04:34,260 --> 00:04:34,980
你是指什么
What are you talking about?

128
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:36,200
眼皮下垂
It's droopy.

129
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:37,020
你说"下垂"是什么意思
What do you mean, "Droopy"?

130
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:39,371
我不喜欢你变这样 杰
Aah. I don't like the look of that, Jay.

131
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,080
等下 我帮你查一查
Here, let me check something.

132
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:43,100
把那东西放一边去 我去看了皮肤科医生
Put that thing away. I saw my dermatologist.

133
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:44,500
他帮我检查下痣什么的
He was checking for moles or something.

134
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:46,140
可能注射了点麻药吧
He probably got some numbing cream on it.

135
00:04:46,140 --> 00:04:47,000
没事
It's fine!

136
00:04:47,780 --> 00:04:48,580
没什么可担心的
Nothing to worry about.

137
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,040
我去打肉毒杆菌了
I got botox.

138
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,460
被一个笨蛋医生忽悠的
Stupid doctor talked me into it,

139
00:04:54,460 --> 00:04:55,300
现在都走样了
And now it's drifting.

140
00:04:56,380 --> 00:04:57,920
我很久没觉得自己这么蠢了
I haven't felt this dumb since

141
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,620
上一次是花了30美元买了个
I shelled out 30 bucks for that bracelet

142
00:04:59,620 --> 00:05:02,275
据说能让我身体平衡性更好的手镯
that's supposed to give me better balance.

143
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:03,680
-试着把我的手臂压下去 -好的
- Try to push my arm down. - Okay.

144
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:05,220
来吧 你做不到 你做不到
Go ahead. You can't do it. You can't do it.

145
00:05:05,220 --> 00:05:06,926
-好的 我是做不到 -亲爱的 我回来了
- Okay. All right. I can't -- - Honey, I'm home.

146
00:05:06,926 --> 00:05:08,970
你老爸的车怎么停在咱们家呢
Hey, uh, why is your dad's car here?

147
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:14,520
"在过去的三年中 大部分的同学
"It's ironic that I stand up here

148
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:15,920
都视我为隐形人
representing my classmates when,

149
00:05:16,100 --> 00:05:17,240
而讽刺的是
for the past three years,

150
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:19,620
如今我却站在这里作为学生代表
most of them have treated me like I'm invisible.

151
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,020
这是我自找的
It's my own fault.

152
00:05:21,260 --> 00:05:22,600
因为我在乎的是好成绩
I was obsessed with good grades

153
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:25,500
而不是长相 人气 或是紧身牛仔裤"
instead of looks, popularity, and skinny jeans."

154
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,020
什么 这就是你的演讲台词么
What?! Is that your speech?!

155
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:27,900
滚出去
Get out of here!

156
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,520
你不能说这些
You cannot say that!

157
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:31,360
当然能 你想知道为什么吗
Yes, I can! And you want to know why?

158
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,540
因为这都是实话
'cause it's the truth.

159
00:05:32,540 --> 00:05:34,420
没有谁想听到实话
No one wants to hear the truth.

160
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,900
这很简单 艾丽克斯
It's very simple, Alex.

161
00:05:35,900 --> 00:05:37,240
做一个好的演讲
In order to give a good speech,

162
00:05:37,380 --> 00:05:39,440
你只是随便串几首歌名就行了
all you have to do is take a song and say it,

163
00:05:39,487 --> 00:05:41,102
像是《永远相信自己》
like... "Don't stop believin'"

164
00:05:41,140 --> 00:05:42,620
或是《开始狂欢吧》
or "Get this party started."

165
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:43,780
这没有任何意义
That means nothing.

166
00:05:44,540 --> 00:05:45,500
谁在乎
Who cares?

167
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,220
没谁想要动脑子
Nobody wants to think.

168
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:48,240
这可是毕业礼
It's a graduation,

169
00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:50,160
庆祝你们不需再开动脑筋的典礼
a celebration of being done with thinking.

170
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,600
人们想要被挑战
People want to be challenged.

171
00:05:51,641 --> 00:05:53,299
他们会因此而尊敬我
They're gonna respect me for it.

172
00:05:53,330 --> 00:05:56,479
以后没人会想跟你说话
No one's ever gonna talk to you again.

173
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:57,520
那又怎样
So what?

174
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,600
莫罕达斯·甘地 为了自己的信仰
Mahatma Gandhi went on a hunger strike

175
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,760
而绝食
for what he believed in.

176
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:05,320
那是因为没人愿意和他一起在餐厅吃饭
That's 'cause no one would eat with him in the cafeteria!

177
00:06:10,957 --> 00:06:12,020
-伙计们 -我们在这
- Hey, guys! - We're here.

178
00:06:12,020 --> 00:06:13,960
快过来 喝点柠檬水 吃点饼干
Come on over. Have some lemonade and cookies.

179
00:06:13,987 --> 00:06:15,360
杰 看起来是不太妙啊
Jay, that's not looking very good.

180
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:15,940
没事的
It's fine.

181
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,500
速答 谁是总统
Quick! Who's the president?

182
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,580
-奥巴马 -菲尔 拜托
- Obama! - Phil, please.

183
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,920
我在测试是不是中风呢
I'm trying to rule out a stroke.

184
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:21,880
这不是中风
It's not a stroke.

185
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,500
为什么大家总觉得我会中风呢
Why does everybody always assume I'm having a stroke?

186
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:25,440
-年龄 -饮食
- Age. - Diet.

187
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,180
你忘记给我买面包了
You forgot to bring my bread.

188
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,700
对不起我们迟到了
I'm sorry we're late.

189
00:06:28,756 --> 00:06:31,760
没事的 不过我们五分钟后要出发
That's okay. We got to leave in about 5 minutes, though.

190
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,200
卢克 不要玩弄那个球
Luke, stop pushing that ball around!

191
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,080
你会掉进去的
You're gonna fall in.

192
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,400
没错 然后你舅舅米奇尔
Oh, yes, and then your uncle Mitchell

193
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:36,760
就会幸灾乐祸
will laugh at your expense!

194
00:06:37,180 --> 00:06:39,180
我是说这是一种性格缺陷
I'm just saying it's a character flaw.

195
00:06:39,180 --> 00:06:40,780
够了够了 做个快速调查
Okay, okay, quick poll here.

196
00:06:40,780 --> 00:06:43,360
今早 小卡穿戴整齐
This morning, Cam, fully dressed...

197
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:44,680
还好是穿着衣服会发生的事情
Thank god it's one of those stories.

198
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:47,380
当他正严肃地思考时
...while in the middle of a very serious thought,

199
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:49,620
突然掉进了小孩泳池
fell into a ducky pool.

200
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,800
老天 你没事吧
Oh, my goodness. Are you all right?

201
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,380
我没事 谢谢
Yes, I am. Thank you.

202
00:06:53,380 --> 00:06:56,080
这才是正常的反应 爱和关心
That is a normal reaction -- love and concern.

203
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:57,588
好的 故事还没说完
Okay, wait, wait, wait, wait.

204
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,240
泳池都发出爆裂声了
The pool popped.

205
00:07:00,739 --> 00:07:02,401
可怜的小东西
Ay! Poor thing!

206
00:07:02,456 --> 00:07:04,348
-尾骨受伤后果不不堪设想啊 -我知道
- There is nothing worse than a tailbone injury. - I know.

207
00:07:04,392 --> 00:07:06,120
真的假的 不不不
Seriously? No, no, no, no.

208
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,880
你们都是装出来的
You're so full of it.

209
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:07,760
你们明明觉得这很搞笑
You know this is funny.

210
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:09,520
想象一下 他这身形
Picture this

211
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:11,940
掉进一个小池子哦
falling into a tiny pool.

212
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:15,660
他这一周都会在这儿呆着哦 伙计们
He'll be here all week, folks!

213
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,560
我是说真的 你别想跟我回家
Literally, because you're not coming home with me.

214
00:07:17,575 --> 00:07:20,120
她来了 小可爱斯黛拉来了
There she is. There's my little Stella.

215
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:20,940
我的乖狗狗
That's my girl.

216
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:22,080
亲爱的
Hi, sweetie.

217
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:22,660
你太可爱了
You're so cute,

218
00:07:22,660 --> 00:07:23,768
我想把你的小脸蛋吃掉
I just wan eat your face!

219
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,940
还记得当初你也这么抱着艾丽克斯
You remember when you used to hold alex like that,

220
00:07:27,940 --> 00:07:29,180
说她可爱的让你想吃掉吗
and you wanted to eat her face?

221
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:29,920
没错
Yeah.

222
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,439
现在她就要步入高中了
Now she's off to high school. Mm.

223
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,860
时光飞逝 对吧
Time marches on, huh?

224
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:33,500
没错
Yep.

225
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:35,040
你知道什么才是最悲伤的吗
You know what's really sad?

226
