Suddenly it's all very clear.

246
00:08:18,420 --> 00:08:20,475
小心 你可能会撞上去哦
Be careful. You might run into it.

247
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:23,280
对不起
I'm sorry.

248
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,540
小卡 不好意思
I'm sorry, Cam. I'm sorry.

249
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,200
天啊 老爸 你的脸
oh, my god, dad, your face!

250
