什么 没事没事
What? Oh, that's nothing, nothing.

251
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,440
没事的 我就去看了下皮肤科
It's boring. I went to the dermatologist.

252
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:31,300
无聊瞎鼓捣了下 我没事
It's a boring story. I'm fine.

253
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:33,600
-不 我们带你去医院 -我没事
- No, no, no, we got to get you to a hospital. - I'm fine.

254
00:08:33,613 --> 00:08:34,446
是的 我带你去 走
Yes, I'm taking you. Come.

255
00:08:34,466 --> 00:08:35,144
歌洛莉亚 不 等等
Gloria, no, wait.

256
