I had a bad reaction.

266
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,240
可能碰到神经或什么了
Hit a nerve or something.

267
00:08:57,260 --> 00:08:58,708
很快就会好了
It's gonna go away soon.

268
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:00,920
干嘛 你这是什么态度
What? What's that supposed to mean?

269
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:03,440
没什么
Nothing.

270
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:04,180
你可以不要这样吗
Would you stop?

271
00:09:04,460 --> 00:09:06,880
