你到底在想什么 你可是个老兵啊
What were you thinking? You're a veteran.

289
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:45,589
够了 谈话到此为止 我们走
Enough! This conversation is ended. Let's go.

290
00:09:47,260 --> 00:09:48,920
你们觉得他连屁股也整了吗
Do you think he got his butt done, too?

291
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,060
看起来相当正啊
It looks fantastic.

292
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:54,560
艾丽克斯 等下 对不起
Alex, wait. I'm sorry.

293
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:57,300
如果你想按那稿子讲 就这样做吧
If you want to give your speech, go ahead.

294
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:59,440
我从来没致过词 没资格说三道四
I was never valedictorian. What do I know?

295
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,420
谢谢
Thank you!

296
00:10:00,700 --> 00:10:02,320
我这么做是有原因的
I am doing this for a reason.

297
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,480
我不是
It's not just like I'm --

298
00:10:04,220 --> 00:10:07,040
对不起 艾丽克斯 以后你会谢我的
Aha! Sorry, Alex, but you will thank me one day!

299
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:10,340
拜托 你觉得我会没有副本吗
Please. You really think I don't have duplicates?

300
00:10:11,180 --> 00:10:13,400
如果你这么做 你会变成社交圈的食人鱼[社交怪胎]
If you do this, you'll be a social piranha.

301
00:10:13,620 --> 00:10:16,480
是的 我会成为亚马逊肉食性鱼类
Yes, I'll be an amazonian carnivorous fish.

302
00:10:18,700 --> 00:10:19,760
肉食什么
Carniv-- what?!

303
