怎么了 发生什么事了
What? What's happening?

306
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,400
门又卡住了
It's stuck again.

307
00:10:34,620 --> 00:10:36,020
门卡住是什么意思
What do you mean, it's stuck?

308
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:36,960
你不能打开吗
Can't you get it open?

309
00:10:37,100 --> 00:10:38,520
"卡住"不就是打不开的意思吗 克莱尔
What do you think "stuck" Means, Claire?

310
00:10:38,660 --> 00:10:40,740
我们得想点办法 老爸
We have to do something, dad.

311
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:42,860
你能不能把门推开 或用别什么方法吗
Can't you -- can't you push it open or something?

312
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:43,880
不知道
I don't know!

313
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:45,960
我们困在你的车道上
We are trapped in your driveway,

314
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,300
你说不知道怎么办
and you don't know?

315
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:49,000
老爸 作为这扇门的主人
As a gate owner, dad,

316
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,960
你要负责
you have a certain responsibility.

317
00:10:50,009 --> 00:10:53,571
我女儿将要
See, my daughter is gonna get up on that stage

318
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:54,580
登台演讲
and give a speech

319
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:55,840
然后从中学毕业
and graduate from middle school,

320
00:10:55,860 --> 00:10:57,660
如果我不能在场的话 我会崩溃的
and if I am not there, dad, I am going to freak out!

321
00:10:57,740 --> 00:10:58,540
我会崩溃的
I am going to freak out!

322
