-或许可以推开 -你明白我的心情吗
- Maybe push it.- Do you understand what I am saying?

323
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,560
你明白这有多重要吗
Do you have any idea how important...

324
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:03,800
-你为什么在笑 -我没有 我没有笑
- Why are you smiling? - I'm not -- I'm not smiling.

325
00:11:07,780 --> 00:11:08,500
歇斯底里的妻子
Hysterical wife.

326
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,880
歇斯底里的妻子
Hysterical wife.

327
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:11,460
歇斯底里的妻子
Hysterical wife.

328
