好吧 我们试试这个方法
All right. Okay, we have tried this way.

331
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,480
把门撞开 孩子们 让开
I say we ram the gate. Kids, get out of the way.

332
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,440
等等 我觉得我可以搞定
Hold on! I think I can fix this!

333
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:25,760
我需要一个回形针 橄榄油
I just need a paper clip, some olive oil,

334
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:26,260
还要缎带
and a ribbon.

335
00:11:26,260 --> 00:11:27,720
你准备怎么做 能工巧匠
What's the plan, "Macgayver"?

336
00:11:27,757 --> 00:11:29,120
事实上 回形针
Actually, the paper clip

337
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,440
是用来连接这两个电路的
is to connect these two circuits,

338
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,500
橄榄油是用来润滑的
and the olive oil is to lubricate the mechanism.

339
00:11:33,060 --> 00:11:34,240
缎带是给莉莉的
And the hair ribbon is for Lily.

340
00:11:34,340 --> 00:11:35,580
她的发型让我抓狂了一天了
Her hair's been driving me crazy all day.

341
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:37,380
我们可以打车去
Why don't we just call some cabs?

342
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,140
因为 米奇尔 这里不是泰晤士广场
Because, Mitchell, this is not Times Square,

343
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:39,960
我们打不到车的
and they'll take forever.

344
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,880
那我们爬过围墙 跑步过去
Well, then we'll just climb over the fence and start running.

345
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:44,000
不 菲尔 学校离这5英里
No, we won't, because it's 5 miles away, Phil!

346
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,900
我还穿着美美的高跟鞋 所以不行
And I'm in big shoes, so, no.

347
