Champagne problems, right?

358
00:12:05,192 --> 00:12:07,625
亲爱的 他们不会骑这脚踏车的
Honey, they're not gonna ride the bike.

359
00:12:07,660 --> 00:12:09,840
但我还是觉得我们应该把它扔过去
Yeah, but I still think that we should throw it over the gate.

360
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:11,000
好吧 你知道吗
Okay, you know what?

361
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:12,320
谢谢 谢谢了
Thank you. Thank you.

362
00:12:12,460 --> 00:12:13,800
没人想出有建设性的办法
Nobody else has come up with an idea.

363
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:15,620
我有办法
I think I've got a good idea.

364
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:17,700
伙计 我们没时间造火箭
We don't have time to build a rocket, buddy.

365
00:12:18,620 --> 00:12:19,320
