367
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:22,560
那菲尔和我先过去
Phil and I will go over first,

368
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:23,920
然后你们把车扔过来
And then you guys will throw over the bike?

369
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,400
好了 上来吧 我把你举上去
Okay, step up. I'll boost you.

370
00:12:25,900 --> 00:12:26,640
咱们不能找架梯子来吗
Couldn't we get a ladder?

371
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:29,020
拜托 我当拉拉队叠罗汉的时候
Please, on cheer squad I boosted girls bigger than you

372
00:12:29,020 --> 00:12:30,360
还举过比你壮的女生呢
to the top of a human pyramid.

373
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:31,820
现在 手放两边
Now, arms at your side.

374
00:12:31,860 --> 00:12:32,980
身体打直
Straight like a pencil.

375
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,320
一 二...
One, two...

376
00:12:35,460 --> 00:12:37,380
我们壮如斗牛犬
We are bulldogs!

377
00:12:40,660 --> 00:12:41,320
她没事
She's fine.

378
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:43,500
好了 杰 现在该你来弄我了
Okay. Jay, now you do me.

379
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,880
用力一把抓就行 别害羞
Just grab a handful. Don't be shy.

380
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,860
现在没剩多少肉了
I'm not giving you as much to work with.

381
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,580
以前挺丰满的 现在瘦了不少
I used to have a lot more there. I lost it.

382
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:53,020
他们以前都叫我"肥臀"
They used to call me "The grand can."

383
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:01,320
"讽刺的是 如今我却站在这里
"It's ironic that I stand up here

384
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:03,620
作为学生代表 在过去的三年中"
Representing my classmates when, for the past..."

385
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,760
我读完你的演讲稿了
I read the rest of your speech.

386
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:06,900
祝贺你
Congratulations.

387
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,260
你是讨厌我吗
Do you hate me?

388
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:10,100
什么
What?!

389
00:13:10,420 --> 00:13:12,880
你说那些受欢迎的孩子们有多肤浅多不堪
You talk about how all the popular kids are shallow and lame.

390
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:14,000
我并不是在说你
I didn't mean you.

391
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:15,860
你以为你把每个人都看得很透彻
You think you have everyone figured out,

392
00:13:15,860 --> 00:13:17,820
但是其实每个人都有自己的难言之隐
but everybody has their stuff.

393
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:19,420
你能有什么难言之隐
What "Stuff" do you have?

394
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:22,340
有太多男孩追 还是有太多派对要参加
Too many boys chasing after you? Too many parties?

395
00:13:23,060 --> 00:13:25,260
你真的想知道我有什么难言之隐吗
You really want to know what "stuff" I have?

396
00:13:25,340 --> 00:13:25,820
没错
Yeah.

397
00:13:26,380 --> 00:13:27,900
我的生物课挂科了
I'm flunking out of biology.

398
00:13:27,900 --> 00:13:29,780
现在我不得不去上暑期班
And now I have to go to summer school.

399
00:13:30,380 --> 00:13:32,900
我的朋友们 他们现在讨论的唯一话题
My friends -- all they can ever talk about nowadays

400
00:13:32,900 --> 00:13:33,800
就是上大学
is going off to college,

401
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,680
而我甚至都不确定自己是否能上大学
and I don't even know if I can get into college.

402
00:13:36,060 --> 00:13:37,680
这点难言之隐对你来说够了吗
Is that enough "Stuff" For you?

403
00:13:38,020 --> 00:13:38,460
随便吧
Whatever.

404
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,240
你知道吗
You know what?

405
00:13:40,780 --> 00:13:42,600
随你好了 照着你那破稿子念吧
Fine. Give your stupid speech.

406
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:43,280
享受被人排挤的生活吧
Be an outcast.

407
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:44,660
但你这么做只会害到自己
But you're only doing it to yourself

408
00:13:44,660 --> 00:13:46,440
因为你聪明又漂亮
because you're smart and pretty

409
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:48,580
还透着一股虽然我不太懂
and sort of funny in a way that I don't really get

410
00:13:48,580 --> 00:13:50,000
但其他人似乎很喜欢的幽默感
but other people seem to enjoy,

411
00:13:50,021 --> 00:13:52,063
所以 要么你明年开始新生活
So, you can either start fresh next year

412
00:13:52,094 --> 00:13:54,914
要么成为那个对全班竖中指的怪胎
or be the freak who flipped off her class.

413
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:56,660
你真的我觉得我漂亮吗
You really think I'm pretty?

414
00:13:56,900 --> 00:13:57,520
闭嘴
Shut up!

415
00:14:03,860 --> 00:14:05,000
菲尔 走直线
Phil, go straight!

416
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:05,940
这样会更快
This way's faster!

417
00:14:05,980 --> 00:14:06,460
不要 直着走
No, straight!

418
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:07,060
别再往那边歪了
Stop leaning!

419
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:08,740
-你想来开路吗 -我想
- Do you want to drive?! - I do.

420
00:14:08,940 --> 00:14:09,980
没门 是我先说的
Tough, I called it!

421
00:14:10,028 --> 00:14:10,902
我晕
D'oh.

422
00:14:10,940 --> 00:14:12,040
那是怎么回事
What was that?!

423
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:14,420
妈的 车链子断了
Oh, crap. The chain broke!

424
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:16,020
接着蹬就行了 那个不要紧的
Just keep pedaling. It doesn't matter.

425
00:14:16,140 --> 00:14:17,200
那个有点要紧
It matters a little!

426
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:20,000
小卡 务必要小心啊
Cam, please be careful.

427
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:20,600
为什么
Why?

428
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:22,680
要是我被电死了 我的帽子就会爆飞
If I get electrocuted, my hat might blow right off.

429
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:24,218
而这个场景很可笑 对吗
That would be funny. It's that, all right?

430
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:25,780
不是 不是
No, no.

431
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:27,657
杰
Hey, Jay!

432
00:14:28,664 --> 00:14:30,531
我知道你觉得难为情
I know you're feeling self-conscious,

433
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:32,720
所以我找了点对你有用的东西
so I dug out something I thought might help.

434
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:33,960
把那玩意儿拿开
Put that thing away.

435
00:14:34,260 --> 00:14:36,320
我就知道你会这么说 但听我说完
I knew you'd say that, but hear me out.

436
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,620
这是专门为惊悚恐怖的人
This was designed to make

437
00:14:37,629 --> 00:14:39,902
变身超酷型男而设计的
A hideously disfigured man look supercool.

438
00:14:39,940 --> 00:14:41,120
这简直太适合你了
It's perfect for you.

439
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,760
哎呀 太恶心了 好吧
Oh, yikes. Okay.

440
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:45,188
我上楼去看看 还有没有左边脸的
I'll go upstairs and see if I hava lefty.

441
00:14:49,020 --> 00:14:50,380
别那么看着我
Don't look at me like that.

442
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:53,380
我不得不说 我对你去做这种事
I have to say that I am a little disappointed

443
00:14:53,380 --> 00:14:54,700
感到有点失望
in you doing this thing.

444
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:55,340
我可不失望
Not me.

445
00:14:55,340 --> 00:14:56,700
我感觉好极了
I feel real good about it.

446
00:14:56,758 --> 00:14:58,885
我都告诉你多少遍了
Now many times do I have to tell you

447
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,700
不需要特地为我变年轻
that you don't have to look young for me?

448
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:01,880
我不是为了你才那么做的
I didn't do it for you.

449
00:15:02,002 --> 00:15:02,925
那是为了谁
What is her name?!

450
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:03,360
别闹了
Stop.

451
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,380
大多数时候 我边走边想
Most of the time, I walk around,

452
00:15:05,411 --> 00:15:07,438
在脑子里想 觉得自己只有四十岁
and in my head, I'm 40.

453
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,540
而当我照镜子的时候
Then I look in the mirror,

454
00:15:09,160 --> 00:15:10,380
我会问自己 "这个老男人是谁
I say, "Who's that old man?

455
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,140
他在我的浴室做什么"
And what's he doing in my bathroom?"

456
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,880
那也是我的浴室啊
Well, it's my bathroom, too.

457
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:16,160
我喜欢那里面有个老男人
And I like when the old guy is there.

458
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:19,840
我爱上的就是你这张脸
This is the face that I fell in love with.

459
00:15:20,740 --> 00:15:21,820
不是这边
Not this face --

460
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:22,480
是这半边
This one.

461
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:24,560
门打开了 门打开了
The gate's opening! The gate's opening!

462
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,220
-你怎么做到的 -我什么也没做
- How did you do that? - I didn't do anything.

463
00:15:26,258 --> 00:15:27,497
是我做的
I did it.

464
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:29,120
我用我的思想打开了它
I opened it with my mind.

465
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:30,320
大家快来
Come on, guys!

466
00:15:30,363 --> 00:15:32,449
-咱们快走吧 -对 咱们走
- Let's go, guys! - Yeah, let's go.

467
00:15:32,492 --> 00:15:34,037
-曼尼 -快去叫曼尼
- Manny! - Get manny.

468
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,380
所有人都上车 咱们走
Everyone in the car. Let's go!

469
00:15:35,780 --> 00:15:38,080
没错 跟我想的一样 链子断了
Yep. That's what I thought. Chain's broken.

470
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:39,700
你有什么想法
What do you think?

471
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:42,240
我觉得咱们得走了
I think we gotta go.

472
00:15:42,865 --> 00:15:46,920
宝贝 我们 我们不可能走着去
Sweetie, we-- we can't make it on foot.

473
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:48,080
我们总得试试
We have to try.

474
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:49,500
宝贝
Honey.

475
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:51,340
宝贝
Honey!

476
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:52,900
没事的
It's okay.

477
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:54,360
怎么会没事 菲尔
It's not okay, phil!

478
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:56,400
明明有事 我们就要失去她了
It's not okay. We're losing her.

479
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,120
-艾丽克斯吗 -对
- Alex? - Yes.

480
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,220
你不会失去她的
You're not losing her.

481
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:01,160
会的 她要去上高中了
We are. She's going to high school.

482
00:16:01,660 --> 00:16:03,060
我当初也是这么失去海莉的
This is just when I lost Haley.

483
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:06,000
海莉从我印象中可爱小天使
This is when Haley went from being my sweet little angel

484
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:07,580
变成一个情绪化
to being a moody,

485
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,820
爱发短信 又蛮横无理的傲娇公主
texting, snotty little princess

486
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:10,780
而且她还讨厌我
who hates me.

487
00:16:11,520 --> 00:16:13,120
海莉才不讨厌你
Haley doesn't hate you.

488
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:14,800
而且我们也不会失去她
And we're not losing her.

489
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:17,100
你还记得你以前下班回到家
Do you remember when you used to come home from work

490
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:18,820
海莉会穿着她的小"阿拉丁"睡衣
and Haley would meet you at the door

491
00:16:18,882 --> 00:16:21,149
在门口迎接你吗
in her little "Aladdin" Pajamas?

492
00:16:21,180 --> 00:16:22,760
而且 她还会高举着双臂
And, you know, she'd stick her arms up in the air

493
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:25,580
然后说 "老爸老爸 带我一起去魔毯之旅"
And say, "Daddy, daddy, take me on a magic carpet ride."

494
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:26,580
还记得吗
Remember that?

495
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:30,040
离上次海莉见到你很兴奋有多久了
When was the last time Haley was that excited to see you?

496
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:33,780
久到我忘了
I don't remember. It's been so long.

497
00:16:35,340 --> 00:16:36,660
我们又要失去另一个女儿了
We're losing another one.

498
00:16:36,704 --> 00:16:38,917
孩子们就是这样的 他们离开
And that's what kids do -- they leave.

499
00:16:38,951 --> 00:16:43,167
一个接一个地离开 然后再也不回来
They leave, and they -- and they don't come back.

500
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,700
我们的孩子会回来的 对吧
Well, ours will come back, right?

501
00:16:44,734 --> 00:16:45,806
要是不回来呢
What if they don't,and --

502
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:48,420
很快 就只剩我们俩了
and, pretty soon, it's just the two of us?

503
00:16:49,920 --> 00:16:51,880
我再也不想去维加斯了
I don't want to go to Vegas anymore.

504
00:16:52,020 --> 00:16:52,480
我知道
I know.

505
00:16:52,517 --> 00:16:53,552
我只想抱着他们
I just want to hug them

506
00:16:53,580 --> 00:16:55,320
让他们在朋友面前出糗
and embarrass them in front of their friends.

507
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:56,720
我知道
I know.

508
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,720
艾丽克斯 天啊
And Alex -- my god.

509
00:16:59,420 --> 00:17:00,720
要是我们错过了演讲
If we miss this speech --

510
00:17:01,300 --> 00:17:03,420
亲爱的 她是咱家老二
Honey, she's a middle child --

511
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,680
她不会原谅我们的
She will never forgive us.

512
00:17:05,745 --> 00:17:08,388
我们不会错过演讲的
We're not missing that speech!

513
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:09,280
停车 停车
Hello! Hello!

514
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:11,040
你要怎么做 菲尔
What's the plan, Phil?

515
00:17:11,420 --> 00:17:12,980
我叫菲利
Mi nombre es Felipe.

516
00:17:13,700 --> 00:17:14,180
你开去...
Yo voy...

517
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:15,400
一个学校
a la escuela.

518
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:16,540
你想搭顺风车去学校
You need a ride to the school.

519
00:17:16,620 --> 00:17:17,280
是的 拜托了
Yes, please!

520
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:18,680
你叫菲利
Felipe?

521
00:17:22,886 --> 00:17:24,124
行了
Okay.

522
00:17:24,168 --> 00:17:26,096
快点 兄弟
V anos,muchachos!

523
00:17:31,660 --> 00:17:33,620
我很荣幸站在
I am so proud to be standing

524
00:17:33,620 --> 00:17:36,160
这一群杰出的青少年面前
in front of this extraordinary group of youngsters.

525
00:17:36,660 --> 00:17:39,760
抱歉 或者我应该改成"老生们"
I'm sorry -- or should I say "Oldsters"?

526
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:42,408
但说实话 "毕业典礼"这词
But seriously, the word "Commencement"

527
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:44,100
代表的是"开始"
means "Beginning."

528
00:17:44,137 --> 00:17:45,541
我很抱歉我笑话了你
I'm sorry I laughed.

529
00:17:45,541 --> 00:17:47,118
我才不要你道歉
I don't need an apology,

530
00:17:47,180 --> 00:17:48,660
但必须要说你今天的行为
But I will say your behavior today

531
00:17:48,694 --> 00:17:50,132
让人大开眼界
has been very eye-opening.

532
00:17:50,155 --> 00:17:51,380
无意冒犯 杰
No offense, Ja

533
00:17:51,414 --> 00:17:54,640
没事 你看上去像个冰山
None taken. You look like an iceberg.

534
00:17:55,460 --> 00:17:55,960
行了
Okay.

535
00:17:56,001 --> 00:17:58,910
是这儿 就这儿
This is...right here.

536
00:18:01,798 --> 00:18:03,139
好了 快走
Okay. Let's go.

537
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,820
非常感谢 兄弟
Muchas gracias, muchachos!

538
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:06,240
太客气了
You're quite welcome!

539
00:18:07,900 --> 00:18:10,400
现在 我们有请学生致辞代表
And now, please welcome your valedictorian,

540
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:11,640
艾丽克斯·邓菲
Alex Dunphy.

541
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:19,700
我爸妈呢
Where's my mom and dad?

542
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:20,600
谢谢
Thank you.

543
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:22,961
他们来了
Mm -- there they are!

544
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:25,876
快点 菲尔
Come on, Phil!

545
00:18:25,914 --> 00:18:27,935
敬爱的凯斯勒校长
Principal Kaizler...

546
00:18:27,974 --> 00:18:28,936
-等等 菲尔 -全体老师
- Hold on, Phil! ... - faculty...

547
00:18:28,936 --> 00:18:29,636
-亲爱的 我滑倒了 -天呐 菲尔
- Oh, sweet cream! I'm sliding! - Oh, my god, phil!

548
00:18:29,636 --> 00:18:30,986
-校董成员 -我抓住你了 起来
...school-board administrators... - I got you. Get up. Get up.

549
00:18:30,986 --> 00:18:32,550
-我抓住你了 -各位毕业生
- I got you. ... - fellow graduates...

550
00:18:32,550 --> 00:18:33,240
对不起对不起
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

551
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:35,520
各位家长 以及
...parents, and everyone

552
00:18:35,552 --> 00:18:37,859
伴我们度过具有挑战的青春期阶段的每一位
who helped us through these challenging formative years,

553
00:18:37,870 --> 00:18:40,112
小卡 你这是五十步笑一百步
Cam! You have lost all credibility.

554
